      "text": "Mobil i\u00E7in \u015Fehir ve hizmet arama \u00F6zelli\u011Finde\nerkan\u0131n UX(Kullan\u0131c\u0131 Deneyimi) a\u00E7\u0131s\u0131ndan tam ekran olmas\u0131 gerekir",
